Hybrid Internet Radio Server (Live Broadcast + Recorded Audio AutoDJ)
Features:
- Proper HTTP Chunked & Raw MP3 Stream Ingestion from BUTT / Mixxx / Mobile Apps.
- AutoDJ Engine: Continuous looping of audio/ folder when off-air.
- HTML5 Web Player & Direct /radio.mp3 Stream for Choyong LC90.
